**Lock Type Comparison:**

| Feature | std::lock_guard | std::unique_lock | Required for CV? |
|---------|----------------|------------------|------------------|
| **Manual unlock** | ❌ No | ✅ Yes | ✅ Essential |
| **Manual relock** | ❌ No | ✅ Yes | ✅ Essential |
