  }
  ```
  - find() returns iterator
  - Iterator points directly to element
  - No second search needed
- **Optimization 2: try_emplace() (C++17, most elegant)**
  ```cpp
  auto [it, inserted] = cache.try_emplace(x, compute(x));
  return it->second;
