// - 1000 weak_ptr objects in vector
// - Each weak_ptr: ~16 bytes (pointer + control block pointer)
// - Total: ~16 KB wasted memory
// - Iteration cost: 1000 lock() calls that all return nullptr
```

**Performance Degradation:**

```cpp
