| Pattern | Throughput | Latency | CPU Usage |
|---------|------------|---------|-----------|
| Traditional read/write | 300 MB/s | 100ms | 80% |
| sendfile (zero-copy) | 900 MB/s | 40ms | 20% |
| epoll edge-triggered | 100k req/s | 5ms | 50% |
