**Our implementation is safe:**
```cpp
Vector& operator=(const Vector& other) {
    if (this != &other) {  // ← Self-assignment check
        Vector temp(other);
        swap(temp);
    }
    return *this;
}
```

---

**Problem:** Reallocation invalidates iterators.

```cpp
